<title>UK: Four wet Brents kept by Stasco, BP and Phibro.</title>
<headline>Four wet Brents kept by Stasco, BP and Phibro.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The four Brent cargoes turning wet on Friday were all kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline, two by Stasco, and one each by BP and Phibro, traders said.</p>
<p>Stasco kept the June 21-23 and June 22-24 loaders, BP kept the June 23-25 cargo and Phibro kept a June 23-25, a deferral from June 18-20, the traders added.</p>
<p>--London newsroom, +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
